        "Nernst formula: E_cell = E\xB0_cell - (0.0591 / n) * log([Mg\xB2\u207A] / [Cu\xB2\u207A]).",
        "Substitute: E_cell = 2.71 - (0.0591 / 2) * log(10\u207B\xB3 / 10\u207B\u2074) = 2.71 - 0.02955 * log(10) = 2.71 - 0.0296 = 2.68 V."
