        "Numerator is the scalar triple product representing volume of parallelepiped formed by (a\u2082 - a\u2081), b\u2081, b\u2082.",
        "Denominator | b\u2081 \xD7 b\u2082 | normalizes against the unit normal vector perpendicular to both lines.",
