    theoremStatement: "\u222B\u208B\u2090\u1D43 f(x) dx = 2 \xB7 \u222B\u2080\u1D43 f(x) dx if f is an even function [f(-x) = f(x)], and 0 if f is an odd function [f(-x) = -f(x)].",
