        statement: "Substitute AB = (a2 - a1) and n_hat into the projection formula.",
        mathExpression: "d = | (a2 - a1) \xB7 [ (b1 x b2) / |b1 x b2| ] | = | (b1 x b2) \xB7 (a2 - a1) | / |b1 x b2|",
        reasoning: "Magnitude ensures non-negative distance."
